---
const predictions = [
  {
    intervention: '丢失任务必要信息',
    primary: '误差地板上升',
    possible: '任何预算都无法补回被删除的信息'
  },
  {
    intervention: '代理 loss 与效用错位',
    primary: '地板或方向恶化',
    possible: '训练指标继续改善，真实效用提前饱和'
  },
  {
    intervention: '去除 nuisance、对齐结构',
    primary: '样本效率改善',
    possible: '曲线整体下移，指数可能不变'
  },
  {
    intervention: '增加独立且可靠的监督',
    primary: '饱和点推迟',
    possible: '有效区间延长，长尾覆盖改善'
  },
  {
    intervention: '改善信用路径与参数复用',
    primary: '局部斜率或截距改善',
    possible: '相同预算产生更多 held-out 增益'
  }
]
---

<figure
  class='not-prose my-8 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border/60 bg-card'
  aria-labelledby='scaling-predictions-title scaling-predictions-caption'
>
  <div class='p-3 sm:p-5'>
    <p id='scaling-predictions-title' class='m-0 text-base font-semibold text-foreground'>
      干预什么，曲线应该怎样变化
    </p>
    <p class='mb-0 mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground'>
      不把所有改善都压缩成一个 Scaling exponent。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div
    class='hidden grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr_1.6fr] border-y border-border/60 bg-muted/35 px-5 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground md:grid'
  >
    <span>受控干预</span>
    <span>首要预测</span>
    <span>曲线表现</span>
  </div>

  <ul class='m-0 list-none p-0' role='list'>
    {
      predictions.map((item, index) => (
        <li
          class:list={[
            'grid gap-2 px-3 py-4 text-sm md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr_1.6fr] md:px-5',
            index > 0 && 'border-t border-border/60'
          ]}
        >
          <span class='font-semibold text-foreground'>{item.intervention}</span>
          <span class='leading-6 text-primary'>
            <span class='font-semibold text-foreground md:hidden'>首要预测：</span>
            {item.primary}
          </span>
          <span class='leading-6 text-muted-foreground'>
            <span class='font-semibold text-foreground md:hidden'>曲线表现：</span>
            {item.possible}
          </span>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ul>

  <figcaption
    id='scaling-predictions-caption'
    class='border-t border-border/60 px-3 py-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground sm:px-5'
  >
    图 2：同一种表述改进可能影响截距、局部斜率、转折点或地板，不必同时改变全部指标。
  </figcaption>
</figure>
